                      <td class="py-4 px-6 text-gray-600">Time tracking, workload analysis, founder interviews, 360-degree feedback.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-50">
                      <td class="py-4 px-6 font-semibold text-teal-700">Organizational Structure & Team Capabilities</td>
                      <td class="py-4 px-6 text-gray-700">Assessing clarity of roles, delegation effectiveness, team skills, and leadership development.</td>
                      <td class="py-4 px-6 text-gray-600">Organizational charts review, skills gap analysis, team surveys, performance data review.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-50">
                      <td class="py-4 px-6 font-semibold text-teal-700">Business Processes & Systems</td>
