                      <td class="py-4 px-6 text-gray-600">Process mapping, system audits, technology stack review, KPI analysis.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-50">
                      <td class="py-4 px-6 font-semibold text-teal-700">Financial Performance & Growth Metrics</td>
                      <td class="py-4 px-6 text-gray-700">Analyzing profitability, cash flow, revenue growth, customer acquisition costs, and other key metrics.</td>
                      <td class="py-4 px-6 text-gray-600">Financial statement analysis, budget vs. actuals review, sales and marketing performance dashboards.</td>
                    </tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </div>
